        "output_tokens": 206,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 136
        },
        "total_tokens": 1523,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 1317,
            "output_tokens": 206,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 136
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 0
            },
            "total_tokens": 1523,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P07-S01-U10",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "你怕的似乎不只是“黑下去”，而是连“想开机”的愿望都还在，屏幕却再也亮不起来——那种想恢复却无法恢复的可能，才是最让人无力的。可是糯糯替你做的那个决定，好像也说明，你心里还有某个部分在想办法把今天的可能性留住，哪怕它只能先借着猫来做。",
      "request_sha256": "82ea36044f1630f3eeba8b2d9bb2802f8ddc8a2da00b3d76dc541d231b7950f7",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 859,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 0
